  "identity": {
    "playing_style": "Under Genesio (2024-26) Lille combined a compact mid-block with quick vertical transitions and set-piece efficiency, finishing 3rd in Ligue 1 (61 pts, 18-7-9, with 10 away wins and a league-best 23 goals after the 75th minute) and reaching the Europa League round of 16. Davide Ancelotti (appointed 1 June 2026) inherits a squad reshaped by 21 departures; he opened Ligue 1 with a 2-0 win at Angers (Giroud, Tiago Santos) before the deadline-day sale of Fernández-Pardo and arrival of Ueda.",
